ok him in the eye, not even once. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why? Is he really so terrifying? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He wants to look into a mirror, but then he remembers too late that he has smashed everything with a reflective surface. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There's nothing he can do. He feels the scar on his face with his cold fingers, then traces the criss-crossing sewn-up seams down his neck and collar bones..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Test Subject","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Captain Ganglati, we have reached the coordinates.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Proceed with the infiltration and gather intelligence on the target."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Test Subject","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Roger.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He swivels a chair to the right, revealing the patchwork corpse slumped on it with a plush toy in its arms."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just you watch, brother. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This fantastic show is about to begin..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pzzzt..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The test subject has successfully bugged the facility."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Female Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Commander Novikov, your supplies have all been dropped off on Rack B17-19. Please look through them and confirm that everything is in order.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Male Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, I see them.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the way, has Commander Angelia received her supplies for the month?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The man who is casually straightening the corpse's shirt collar suddenly turns his head and stares sharply at the screen."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Female Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry, but I cannot divulge any information regarding another commander's personal matters.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Male Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk, what a knucklehead.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then I'll just have to ask Commander Angelia myself.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Angelia..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The man grins. His flat laughter echoes throughout the spacious room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-70"}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Found you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"1","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Um..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Explo_Distance","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom... The sound of intense gunfire is pervasive even in the dense forest in midsummer, resounding through the thick foliage. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Lying in the grass on her stomach, LAMG turns uneasily to look at her laid-back commander... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She is currently lying on a hammock, dozing off peacefully."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_stage12","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why aren't we attacking...?","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If we wait any longer, there won't be anything left to do other than cleaning up the corpses on the battlefield!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you grumbling about, LAMG?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nothing!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"LAMG has been serving under Commander Angelia for several years, but she still can't make sense of her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Like right now, LAMG is so anxious she is fighting the urge to pace back and forth, but Angelia just turns on her hammock and dozes off again. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After much hemming and hawing, LAMG finally decides to say something."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't it time we moved? The other teams have already engaged the target..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Give it a little longer."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Yes, ma'am."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"LAMG can only swallow her gripes and instructs her other teammates to keep waiting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Say, have you completed the memory integration?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}},{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm? Oh, you mean organizing the neural data across units of the same model... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All neural data have been integrated, and some duplicate and redundant data have been deleted."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}},{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrat