er dumb luck. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No one can deny that you are currently the most outstanding commander at Griffin."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So you're the one who spread all the rumors."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange puts one arm under her head and opens her sleepy eyes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Seeing that her commander seems to be feeling more awake, LAMG presses ahead."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So why are we still not attacking, Commander? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I am not equipped with an advanced command module, but based on what you've taught me... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If our team had stormed the target's right flank 15 minutes ago... the mission could have been completed by now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"LAMG, what is the purpose of Dolls?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange changes the subject abruptly, leaving LAMG's question unanswered. Her eyelids droop again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"LAMG","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"LAMG","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... To complete missions?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's right. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But there's no end to missions."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker